  <WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingString>provocando mutação obelisco: não</WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingString>
  <!-- EN: triggering obelisk mutation -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingStringPending>provocando mutação obelisco</WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingStringPending>
  <!-- EN: Choose who should do this -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.guiLabelString>Escolha quem deve fazer isso</WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.guiLabelString>
  <!-- EN: Trigger mutation -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.jobString>Mutações de gatilho</WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.jobString>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has successfully triggered obelisk mutation. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCompletedString>{PAWN_nameDef} desencadeou com sucesso a mutação obelisco.</WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCompletedString>
  <!-- EN: The twisted obelisk is ready to use again. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCooldownEnded>O obelisco torcido está pronto para usar novamente.</WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCooldownEnded>
  <!-- EN: Mutation cooldown -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.onCooldownString>Refrigeração da mutação</WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.onCooldownString>
  <!-- EN: Permanently and safely disable the twisted obelisk. This will prevent it from activating and being studied further.\n\nRequires 2 shards. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activateDescString>Desativar permanentemente e com segurança o obelisco torcido. Isso irá impedi-lo de ativar e ser estudado mais.\n\nRequer 2 fragmentos.</WarpedObelisk_Mutator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activateDescString>
  <!-- EN: Deactivate... -->
